OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it so hard to find an NHS
OL,4,Adentist? Find out how many have closed
OL,5,Awhere you live
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of dentist practices are
OL,8,Fabandoning NHS work as the service
OL,9,Fdrifts towards a two-tier system, new
OL,10,Fanalysis suggests.
OL,12,FData analysed by the Nuffield Trust
OL,13,Ffound that nearly 600 practices in
OL,14,FEngland have withdrawn from NHS
OL,15,Fdentistry over the last 10 years. The
OL,16,Fdecline has been particularly sharp in
OL,17,Fparts of the South West and East of
OL,18,FEngland, raising concerns about growing
OL,19,Finequalities in access to care.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
