OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAWhy is it so hard to find an NHS
OL,4,Adentist? Find out how many have closed
OL,5,Awhere you live
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe analysis suggests more than one in
OL,8,F10 dental practices that once offered
OL,9,FNHS care no longer do so, leaving it
OL,10,Fnear impossible for some communities to
OL,11,Ffind NHS appointments.
OL,13,FNHS dental activity is 8% lower than it
OL,14,Fwas pre Covid, while six in 10 adults
OL,15,Fhave not seen an NHS dentist in two
OL,16,Fyears. Of those who attempted to get a
OL,17,Fnew appointment in the last two years,
OL,18,Fjust 38% were successful, according to
OL,19,Fthe NHS GP Patient Survey.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
